# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Model weights — NEVER commit (GitHub hard limit: 100 MB/file)
#
#  Branch `origin_26-0364` is the archival snapshot of the finished paper. Policy
#  checkpoints are the one class of artefact kept out of git: they are binary
#  blobs, several exceed the 100 MB limit, and the 119 intermediate checkpoints
#  of the hyper-parameter sweep were pruned. Final policies are published as
#  GitHub Release assets — see MODELS.md.
#
#  TensorBoard event files, by contrast, ARE committed on this branch: they are
#  the raw experimental evidence behind every training curve in the paper.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.engine

models/
checkpoints/
runs/
wandb/
outputs/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Environments
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
.conda/
*.conda

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Editor / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Local configuration / secrets — never commit
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.local.json
config.local.*
.env
.env.*

# SSH / cryptographic key material. This repository lives inside a workspace that
# also holds deploy keys; these rules make it impossible to sweep them in by a
# careless `git add -A`.
.ssh/
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*.pem
*.ppk
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Scraped / regenerated scratch output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*_scratch/
tmp/
scratch/
*.log
